%% frame: UC9 E5: two administrators save the same listing (design)
sequenceDiagram
    actor A1 as Admin 1
    actor A2 as Admin 2
    participant Ctl as :AdminListingController
    participant TA as txA : AdminListingAppServiceImpl
    participant TB as txB : AdminListingAppServiceImpl
    participant Repo as :ProductRepositoryImpl
    participant Map as :BizProductMapper
    participant Prod as :Product

    Note over A1,Prod: B5: both read the listing at version 3, then both save with expectedVersion 3
    A1->>Ctl: revise(productId, request)
    Ctl->>TA: revise(id, detailsA, 3, admin1)
    A2->>Ctl: revise(productId, request)
    Ctl->>TB: revise(id, detailsB, 3, admin2)
    TA->>Repo: lockById(id)
    Repo->>Map: selectActiveByIdForUpdate(id): lock 1
    Repo-->>TA: Product version 3, row locked
    TB->>Repo: lockById(id)
    Repo->>Map: selectActiveByIdForUpdate(id)
    Note over TB,Map: txB waits on the product row
    TA->>Prod: requireVersion(3)
    TA->>Prod: revise(detailsA)
    Prod-->>TA: Product version 4
    TA->>Repo: updateListing(revised, 3, admin1)
    Repo->>Map: updateListing(row, 3, admin1)
    Map-->>Repo: 1 row
    Repo->>Repo: requireChanged(1)
    Note over TA,Map: txA commits; the row lock is released
    TA-->>Ctl: ManagedListing, version 4
    Ctl-->>A1: AdminListingResponse, version 4
    Repo-->>TB: Product version 4, row locked
    TB->>Prod: requireVersion(3)
    Prod-->>TB: E5: PRODUCT_VERSION_CONFLICT, currentVersion 4
    TB-->>Ctl: BizException; txB rolls back, nothing written
    Ctl-->>A2: 412 with currentVersion 4
    Note over A2,Ctl: E5: conflict banner; Admin 2 reloads version 4 and saves again
